  "body": "In all UAs I tested, `<iframe src=\"about:blank\">` is always in HTML mode, even if the parent document is a XHTML document. Such divergency may introduce programming complexcity and bugs. I'd like `<iframe src=\"about:blank\">` to inherit the XHTML-ness of its parent.\n",
